<title>HONG KONG: Hanwha Merchant sets $20 mln club FRCD.</title>
<headline>Hanwha Merchant sets $20 mln club FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hanwha Merchant Banking Corp will complete a US$20 million floating rate certificate of deposit issue as a club deal among a few banks, bankers said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The facility has a final maturity of 364 days.</p>
<p>The issue was priced at par to float at 45 basis points over the six-month London Interbank Offered Rate.</p>
<p>Sumitomo Finance Asia is the sole arranger.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
